    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6917751520dcd99965999471",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "在此育成剧本中，\n基础能力上限将变为以下数值。",
      "source_fingerprint": "52451500041d0286a07df9765702c5cb2e3f3e596a274fa44cb081ab499464f9",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "SingleMode699000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa13035e9afa72ee165a27b2",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "通过继承特定的因子，基础能力上限\n最多可<color=#FF911C>变化</color>至以下数值。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ceb7f11eb0d64cae7e47c1655b4586f412713f60a77fd3b357915e4e5f0042d",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "SingleMode699001"
