      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "SingleMode701027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4650f8879c6cf7346de9435",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "由于要出战资质较低的比赛，\n可能会消耗大量闹钟。\n是否直接开始？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a83ce5bac72c3b600eee83e4ca6b06af43aff6006f1aa08f2c2024540ba5f473",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "SingleMode701028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ad50fbef8f404bcaa322836",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "可以在“闹钟设置”中，\n设置为不在资质较低的比赛中使用闹钟",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f89f61b1e152ce550267159ed9843e0ef3e1bd513c93f06f42fe40377209771",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "SingleMode701029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e2e658fbc8e37c981c17d12",
      "kind": "localize",
      "source_text": "在自主训练育成中出战资质较低的比赛时",
      "source_fingerprint": "49fd6202afe55197dfd5c0aff6787fc8a2f248b24ec7822c42399dc9e411ee49",
      "source_path": "localize_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
